---
interface Props {
  size?: number
  class?: string
  /** Set on the one instance that is the page's primary mark, so it is not
   *  lazy-loaded below a fold it sits above. */
  priority?: boolean
}

const { size = 56, class: className = '', priority = false } = Astro.props
---

{/* Her actual 印泥 chop — the cinnabar seal stamped on Chinese calligraphy,
    and the source of this site's color.

    Replaced the typeset SVG placeholder on 2026-08-20 with a photograph of the
    real impression, supplied by the family. The difference matters: the seal
    is carved in 篆書 (seal script), which is not what the typeset version
    showed, and the pressed edges and broken strokes are hers. A font could
    never produce this.

    All four characters, not just 張: the surname alone names her husband's
    family, while 張馬敏妹 is the 冠夫姓 form carrying her own maiden surname 馬
    inside it. Read top-right, top-left, bottom-right, bottom-left.

    The white paper is keyed to transparent by scripts/build-name-seal.mjs so
    the mark sits on either theme — see that file for why it is NOT recolored
    to --brand. Labeled rather than aria-hidden: unlike an ornamental chop,
    this one carries her name and is the site's mark. */}
<img
  src="/name-seal.png"
  width={size}
  height={size}
  class={className}
  alt="張馬敏妹"
  loading={priority ? 'eager' : 'lazy'}
  fetchpriority={priority ? 'high' : undefined}
  decoding="async"
  style={`width:${size}px;height:${size}px`}
/>
